abstract: >-
  Data, analysis code and report for a 150-point vLLM load sweep of Llama 3.1 70B
  (FP8 weights) on four NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell GPUs: throughput, latency,
  power, GPU activity and KV cache use across input length, output length and
  request rate.
